Key: *_mix_ratio = within-species sample mixing, observed/expected (1.0 = perfectly batch-mixed); *_knn_celltype/subtype = fraction of within-species neighbor weight sharing the cell's label (higher = manifold respects cell types); *_NMI_ct vs *_NMI_sample = joint-leiden agreement with cell types (want HIGH) vs samples (want LOW); map_dec~dec / map_end~end = cross-species alignment score of matched coarse cell types; mean_alignment = hs<->mm average.

